      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSIC LASS (8) box seated before sticking on well to finish 5 lengths away in second (18.23) at Richmond in a NG over 320m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can find winning form. AMAZING GEM (3) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at this track but was a Grade 5 winner two back at this track. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Rates a winning chance on best. HARD STYLE CHICK (5) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 18.41 beating Gladstone Bag. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Expected to measure up again. TRIPLE PHANTOM (1) is worth consideration after filling a hole from the same draw last start.",
